  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R28CPFc.png\" alt=\"粉笔\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">在《我的世界®》广阔的世界中标记你的道路吧！</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">•</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">粉笔让你能在洞穴或建筑中绘制标记，更轻松地导航。</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qx2fgdp.png\" alt=\"粉笔种类\" width=\"1000\" height=\"273\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/f43BLYS.png\" alt=\"符号\" width=\"1000\" height=\"225\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YfuLEeh.png\" alt=\"发光效果\" width=\"1000\" height=\"212\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FjhcKIR.png\" alt=\"粉笔盒\" width=\"1000\" height=\"273\"></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Yb5gsGmDugM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"1000\" height=\"561\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">这是一个 <strong>Forge/NeoForge</strong> 模组。&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">使用 <strong>Fabric</strong>？这里有移植版：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">粉笔（Fabric版）</a> 由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dafuqsy/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">DaFuqsy</a> 制作。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord 服务器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜欢这个模组吗？你的支持将让我能继续完善它，并开发更多模组！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; 